First you have to use the new masm_mrd we created to make
the object file for the assembly code (.asm) to create
the object file (.obj):

./masm_mrd < Oadder.asm > o.obj

Then you have to run the generated .obj file along with the
prom.dat file created previously (or supplied)

./mic1 prom_mrd.dat o.obj 0 2048

